    {
      "id": "gv-714817-b00001",
      "text": "Trinidad and Tobago's general elections are carded for August 10, and with less than a week to go, electioneering has reached a fever pitch.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 1,
      "body_start": 0,
      "body_end": 140,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-714817-b00002",
      "text": "Despite the country's rising numbers of COVID-19 cases, it is not uncommon to see political supporters of both major parties — the incumbent People's National Movement (PNM) and the opposition United National Congress (UNC) — gathered around music trucks that parade through neighbourhoods canvassing votes.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 2,
      "body_start": 142,
      "body_end": 449,
      "source_links": [
        "https://pnmtt.live/",
        "https://unctt.org/",
        "https://www.facebook.com/MinistryofHealthTT/photos/pcb.3577492012280581/3577491705613945/"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-714817-b00003",
      "text": "While voters may be interested in hearing about candidates’ COVID-19 strategies, no one quite expected the seemingly futuristic proposal, put out by the UNC, of “creating a dome around T&T” to “protect our country from all illegal outsiders and activity.” The idea was put forward in an advertisement detailing the party's COVID-19 response plan.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 3,
      "body_start": 451,
      "body_end": 797,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-714817-b00004",
      "text": "Widely shared on social media, the ad claimed that the party, if elected, would have said dome “partly operational within 1 month and fully operational in 6 months”:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 4,
      "body_start": 799,
      "body_end": 964,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-714817-b00005",
      "text": "Reaction was swift — and humourous. In short order, a hashtag — #KamlaDome2020 — was trending locally:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 5,
      "body_start": 966,
      "body_end": 1068,
      "source_links": [
        "https://twitter.com/search?q=%23KamlaDome2020&src=trend_click"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-714817-b00006",
      "text": "Several Twitter users poked fun by wondering how exactly the dome would be constructed:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 6,
      "body_start": 1070,
      "body_end": 1157,
      "source_links": [
        "https://twitter.com/sheryse_b/status/1290692440068939776?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw%7Ctwcamp%5Etweetembed%7Ctwterm%5E1290692440068939776%7Ctwgr%5E&ref_url=https%3A%2F%2Fglobalvoices.org%2F%3Fp%3D714817preview%3Dtrue"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-714817-b00007",
      "text": "Facebook user Quweina Roberts, tongue firmly in cheek, felt that the new dome would create amazing new employment opportunities:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 7,
      "body_start": 1159,
      "body_end": 1287,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-714817-b00008",
      "text": "It was only a matter of time before The Simpsons reference got a local spin:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 8,
      "body_start": 1289,
      "body_end": 1365,
      "source_links": [
        "https://twitter.com/ImbertColm/status/1290715094456860683"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-714817-b00009",
      "text": "Other movie references soon followed:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 9,
      "body_start": 1367,
      "body_end": 1404,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-714817-b00010",
      "text": "Meanwhile, one Twitter user kept thinking up scenarios of all the things that could go wrong once the dome was installed:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 10,
      "body_start": 1406,
      "body_end": 1527,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-714817-b00011",
      "text": "Several Twitter users were concerned about their health:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 11,
      "body_start": 1529,
      "body_end": 1585,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-714817-b00012",
      "text": "Rising temperatures were also a consideration:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 12,
      "body_start": 1587,
      "body_end": 1633,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-714817-b00013",
      "text": "There were hilarious parallels to US President Donald Trump's proposed border wall with Mexico, prompting one Twitter user to quip:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 13,
      "body_start": 1635,
      "body_end": 1766,
      "source_links": [
        "https://twitter.com/DGriffy1990/status/1290707107646406656?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw%7Ctwcamp%5Etweetembed%7Ctwterm%5E1290707107646406656%7Ctwgr%5E&ref_url=https%3A%2F%2Fglobalvoices.org%2F%3Fp%3D714817preview%3Dtrue"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-714817-b00014",
      "text": "Others had questions — so many questions:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 14,
      "body_start": 1768,
      "body_end": 1809,
      "source_links": [],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-714817-b00015",
      "text": "Soon after the UNC realised the dome idea was becoming a national joke, it changed the wording of the ad, and its supporters subsequently claimed that the meaning was misconstrued and that it was really a “radar dome”.",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 15,
      "body_start": 1811,
      "body_end": 2029,
      "source_links": [
        "https://www.facebook.com/permalink.php?story_fbid=10158437966780149&id=686380148"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    },
    {
      "id": "gv-714817-b00016",
      "text": "While a handful of Twitter users were prepared to have a serious discussion about the dome idea, the majority just couldn't let it go:",
      "page": null,
      "paragraph": 16,
      "body_start": 2031,
      "body_end": 2165,
      "source_links": [
        "https://twitter.com/dbushcoolie/status/1290705263402668032",
        "https://twitter.com/msmike772/status/1290698597655285761"
      ],
      "source_kind": "p",
      "source_is_quotation": false
    }
  ],
